<description>&lt;p&gt;Thailand faces multiple pressures: a blaze on Phuket killed at least 11 people, while arsenic levels in the Salween River at the Myanmar border exceed limits, prompting orders for clean water for thousands. Iranian and Hezbollah operatives attempted to recruit Thai clerics for a foiled attack on the Israeli embassy in Bangkok, and a cross-border human-smuggling ring was busted, resulting in four arrests. President Trump signed a trade deal with Thailand despite earlier reports it was unresolved, and Cambodia’s Hun Sen urged border demarcation and took the dispute to international forums. The UCDP recorded 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/live/2026/11/17/world/trump-asean-summit/trumps-trade-deal-with-thailand-is-not-a-done-deal&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTE9HWHI1QlI2ZXlhMXRJZmNQWW50dHFtX0I1UHFCUzhsSXl1bXB1Z1ZKUTJDeDc3ZlV0XzJKaVh6TE9tXzNqU3pLc3ZPM2hZV2lYcjZ4LUZrRmw1ZDlrNzBEYmY1T2lNaTJDMUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Jerusalem Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTFBoMUxYSEozZkRlNUdYV1VXVmpaVkVhRDNrNTJ1M1VEZU5VaGo0NHNOQXNBU1FnRDEyU1Q4ZHp6eWtfVnlRM2o3d3JHVmZMLVl3TVVoNktGbHdyNDA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nation Thailand&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxQbElhWHpDSGo1dDJxeDkxOHVmMC1hXzdOZjZJX1FHQWEzV1loeldqUmI1bjhTZ2k5MUl4ME9IcVBoRFZSUmN3bzJPbzhaNDBVajY4ZnI4ZS1fVGN2TDlHaWdZbWhCc1cxWGQ2Nmtzd3FZN3FQQzlxcGFQYXdKdHFaX25jcWNtcURZTDg1dzlLTzFYLUFldEdyc1ljN3g?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Irrawaddy&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVkFVX3lxTFBpcF